---
title: "cancelAndEmergency (High Level Sale Customer Journey)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: admin initiates cancellation
    q_check_caller --> q_check_cancel_allowed: caller = projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized caller
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_cancel_allowed --> q_check_tokens_supplied: sale not already canceled
    q_check_cancel_allowed --> q_revert_already_canceled: isCanceled = true
    q_revert_already_canceled --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled
    q_check_tokens_supplied --> q_check_capital_withdrawn: tokensSupplied = false
    q_check_tokens_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_check_capital_withdrawn --> q_cancel_direct: capitalWithdrawn = false
    q_check_capital_withdrawn --> q_require_return: capitalWithdrawn = true
    q_require_return --> q_return_capital: project must return withdrawn capital
    q_return_capital --> q_cancel_direct: capital returned to contract
    q_cancel_direct --> q_set_canceled: isCanceled = true
    q_set_canceled --> q_enable_refunds: investors can withdraw via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled
    q_enable_refunds --> [*]: emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_check_cancel_allowed
        INV-001: Cancellation blocked after tokens supplied
        INV-002: For sealed bid auctions, cancellation blocked after initializePublishSaleResults (cancelLocked)
        INV-003: If capital was withdrawn, project must return it before cancellation completes
        INV-004: After cancellation, all investors can reclaim their full invested capital
    end note
